#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:10003
#: 31c41fcb726546008ee0fdb89c6f9408
msgid "Guide to Adstock Transformations in PyMC-Marketing"
msgstr "Guía de las transformaciones de adstock en PyMC-Marketing"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:10005
#: 3b053ff207444f9c8d84d4181a46c329
msgid ""
"This notebook provides a comprehensive overview of the different adstock "
"transformations available in PyMC-Marketing. Adstock effects model the "
"delayed and lagged impact of marketing spend on consumer behavior."
msgstr ""
"Este cuaderno ofrece una visión general completa de las distintas "
"transformaciones de adstock disponibles en PyMC-Marketing. Los efectos de "
"adstock modelan el impacto retardado y rezagado del gasto de marketing en el"
" comportamiento del consumidor."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20002
#: 4a563ff25993412ab2b4db6aa26ff59e
msgid "What is Adstock?"
msgstr "¿Qué es el adstock?"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20004
#: f15fc7c938ef4944845c6dc9c238456b
msgid ""
"**Adstock** (also called the **carryover effect** or **lagged effect**) "
"is a fundamental concept in marketing that models how advertising impact "
"doesn't happen instantaneously. Instead, it **builds up over time and "
"gradually decays**."
msgstr ""
"El **adstock** (también llamado **efecto de arrastre** o **efecto "
"rezagado**) es un concepto fundamental en marketing que modela cómo el "
"impacto de la publicidad no ocurre de forma instantánea. En cambio, **se "
"acumula con el tiempo y decae gradualmente**."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20006
#: 77065f508de94d0b839a49076cf18735
msgid "The Core Idea"
msgstr "La idea central"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20008
#: 1549a43d7bb54bda8ba03e35e843090f
msgid ""
"When you run an advertising campaign, the effects don't just appear in "
"the same week and then disappear completely. There are three major "
"behaviors that we need to keep in mind:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando se ejecuta una campaña publicitaria, los efectos no aparecen "
"simplemente en la misma semana para luego desaparecer por completo. Hay tres"
" comportamientos principales que debemos tener en cuenta:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20010
#: 3424c831d2664308a4dfeba6517b6ed4
msgid ""
"**Memory effect**: Consumers remember your ad after seeing it (think of "
"that jingle from a TV commercial you saw years ago)"
msgstr ""
"**Efecto de memoria**: Los consumidores recuerdan su anuncio después de "
"verlo (piense en ese jingle de un comercial de televisión que vio hace años)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20011
#: 8cc50db20df945399226ebb1711b5da8
msgid ""
"**Delayed response**: It may take time for someone to act on your "
"advertisement"
msgstr ""
"**Respuesta retardada**: Puede pasar tiempo hasta que alguien actúe a raíz "
"de su anuncio"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20012
#: 6bdc63c1edf843a2aefec52d7dc457e5
msgid "**Gradual decay**: The impact slowly fades over subsequent time periods"
msgstr ""
"**Decaimiento gradual**: El impacto se desvanece lentamente en los períodos "
"siguientes"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20014
#: 7f183f4b9be54c2d98e68d49b0692a52
msgid "Why Adstock Matters for MMMs"
msgstr "Por qué el adstock es importante para los MMM"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20016
#: 00177fae012e44e0bf99b513fc0158cc
msgid "Understanding adstock effects is crucial for:"
msgstr "Comprender los efectos de adstock es crucial para:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20018
#: dc4b21b2700b4ce3a2f3cd0b001b4b66
msgid ""
"**Budget Planning**: If a channel has long-lasting effects, you might "
"advertise less frequently but still maintain impact"
msgstr ""
"**Planificación del presupuesto**: Si un canal tiene efectos de larga "
"duración, es posible anunciarse con menos frecuencia y aun así mantener el "
"impacto"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20019
#: 95112c532e9c42a283165818a28f1422
msgid ""
"**Attribution**: Correctly assigning sales to the marketing that caused "
"them, even if there's a time lag"
msgstr ""
"**Atribución**: Asignar correctamente las ventas a las acciones de marketing"
" que las causaron, incluso si existe un rezago temporal"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20020
#: 21721d119475430faf397b1490952a29
msgid ""
"**ROAS Calculation**: Ensuring you capture the full return, not just "
"immediate effects"
msgstr ""
"**Cálculo del ROAS**: Garantizar que se capture el retorno completo, y no "
"solo los efectos inmediatos"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20021
#: bbb3a417206740d091a733320347cb95
msgid ""
"**Channel Comparison**: Different channels have different decay patterns "
"(e.g., TV ads vs. digital banner ads)"
msgstr ""
"**Comparación de canales**: Los distintos canales tienen distintos patrones "
"de decaimiento (por ejemplo, los anuncios de TV frente a los banners "
"digitales)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20023
#: c462353d9680419db550c6888f7f43f8
msgid "Mathematical Representation"
msgstr "Representación matemática"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20025
#: a2314fe53c7143feaa0330d962a0f7ee
msgid ""
"The simplest form is **Geometric Adstock**, where the transformed value "
"at time $t$ is:"
msgstr ""
"La forma más simple es el **adstock geométrico**, donde el valor "
"transformado en el tiempo $t$ es:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20027
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:80011
#: 0e7224a43a5b4f449f1b6597d7caef55 c529d84d952943cabb89209a27f9c3eb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\tilde{x}_t = x_t + \\alpha \\tilde{x}_{t-1}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\tilde{x}_t = x_t + \\alpha \\tilde{x}_{t-1}\n"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20031
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:80015
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240021
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:510015
#: 6828637d5b9e4e39aacbb6eed5dbcaae 7fa8615236a74aa1bd04524a270c5913
#: ac27c7e1383644d19375da7c0150750e acf25222066644648ae525c0505dfc12
msgid "Where:"
msgstr "Donde:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20032
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:80016
#: 2381e10161dd44efaee9716ec057eb76 86b1d579efe44c90b38fa3522486b91c
msgid "$x_t$ is the raw advertising spend at time $t$"
msgstr "$x_t$ es el gasto publicitario sin procesar en el tiempo $t$"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20033
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:80017
#: 2224f6e526604ac0b63e4e270c4423c0 8df92db1d3a3451aa0557e50a4c4f901
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\tilde{x}_t$ is the transformed (adstocked) value"
msgstr "$\\tilde{x}_t$ es el valor transformado (con adstock)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20034
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:80018
#: 3532c3758dc4468bb009a0cfafaeb393 5bb6d2449c0d4678a6dfd0e0e275a0e9
msgid ""
"$\\alpha \\in [0, 1]$ is the **retention rate** (how much of the effect "
"carries over)"
msgstr ""
"$\\alpha \\in [0, 1]$ es la **tasa de retención** (cuánto del efecto se "
"arrastra)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20035
#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:80019
#: c63012397a084940af59038addc6af5a ef6e934d02c14f07ad8424a3315dea67
msgid "Higher $\\alpha$ means slower decay (longer-lasting effects)"
msgstr ""
"Un $\\alpha$ mayor implica un decaimiento más lento (efectos más duraderos)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20037
#: 0d0953acbe004161aeed182def8164d1
msgid ""
"This creates an exponential decay pattern where the effect of advertising"
" in week 0 continues into weeks 1, 2, 3, etc., diminishing by factor "
"$\\alpha$ each period."
msgstr ""
"Esto crea un patrón de decaimiento exponencial en el que el efecto de la "
"publicidad de la semana 0 continúa en las semanas 1, 2, 3, etc., "
"disminuyendo por un factor $\\alpha$ en cada período."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20039
#: 46168087ce6f4828848d6b04a37d2383
msgid "Types of Adstock in PyMC-Marketing"
msgstr "Tipos de adstock en PyMC-Marketing"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20041
#: 48ab27f3b1874bf4b0f399d9c1b590fa
msgid ""
"The library offers several adstock transformations to model different "
"decay patterns:"
msgstr ""
"La biblioteca ofrece varias transformaciones de adstock para modelar "
"distintos patrones de decaimiento:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20043
#: d2e3b92fd0e44b96a5634a4fcd224ef2
msgid ""
"**Geometric Adstock**: Simple exponential decay (most common, good "
"default choice)"
msgstr ""
"**Adstock geométrico**: Decaimiento exponencial simple (el más común, una "
"buena opción predeterminada)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20044
#: dbbe8294bf8f4d30823108803f8c9232
msgid ""
"**Delayed Adstock**: Adds a delay parameter, peak effect happens after "
"$\\theta$ periods"
msgstr ""
"**Adstock con retardo**: Agrega un parámetro de retardo; el efecto máximo "
"ocurre después de $\\theta$ períodos"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20045
#: 982f0ca2318e406a812d2f0a0e9817ed
msgid ""
"**Weibull PDF/CDF Adstock**: More flexible decay curves that can model "
"peak-then-decay patterns"
msgstr ""
"**Adstock Weibull PDF/CDF**: Curvas de decaimiento más flexibles que pueden "
"modelar patrones de pico seguido de decaimiento"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20046
#: a2beda0403234ed18b3a3252374b6eb2
msgid "**Binomial Adstock**: Alternative flexible decay specification"
msgstr ""
"**Adstock binomial**: Especificación alternativa y flexible del decaimiento"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20048
#: 3799623d34ec475a84f44393ad2634cd
msgid "Real-World Intuition"
msgstr "Intuición en el mundo real"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20050
#: d903f5746e8a4a529b9611a80906b621
msgid "Different advertising channels exhibit different decay patterns:"
msgstr ""
"Los distintos canales publicitarios presentan distintos patrones de "
"decaimiento:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20052
#: 293b92166d6f46648f10d1a015e625dc
msgid ""
"**Digital display ads**: Might have $\\alpha \\approx 0.2$ (fast decay, "
"effects last 1-2 weeks)"
msgstr ""
"**Anuncios de display digital**: Podrían tener $\\alpha \\approx 0.2$ "
"(decaimiento rápido, efectos de 1 a 2 semanas)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20053
#: 1356bfebe31849fdb8720f45c16505cd
msgid ""
"**TV brand campaigns**: Might have $\\alpha \\approx 0.7$ (slow decay, "
"effects last months)"
msgstr ""
"**Campañas de marca en TV**: Podrían tener $\\alpha \\approx 0.7$ "
"(decaimiento lento, efectos de meses)"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20054
#: ac9f3f15d5024e7ab3f3bc6996eacee3
msgid ""
"**Billboard advertising**: Might have delayed peak if it takes time for "
"brand awareness to convert to action"
msgstr ""
"**Publicidad en vallas publicitarias**: Podría tener un pico retardado si la"
" conversión de la notoriedad de marca en acción lleva tiempo"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:20056
#: 86893faf1bad446299be7630185c29f9
msgid ""
"The adstock transformation ensures that when you model sales as a "
"function of marketing spend, you're capturing the full temporal dynamics "
"of how advertising actually influences consumer behavior."
msgstr ""
"La transformación de adstock garantiza que, al modelar las ventas como "
"función del gasto de marketing, se capture toda la dinámica temporal de cómo"
" la publicidad influye realmente en el comportamiento del consumidor."

