#: 6de7bed1d774403d9a11501287fadb88
msgid ""
"Here we create a Geometric Adstock instance to help explore different "
"behaviors."
msgstr ""
"Aquí creamos una instancia de adstock geométrico para ayudar a explorar "
"distintos comportamientos."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:90006
#: 794b172e1220405a94d267a6fb2d3937
msgid "We instantiate the `GeometricAdstock` transformer with two key parameters:"
msgstr ""
"Instanciamos el transformador `GeometricAdstock` con dos parámetros clave:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:90007
#: 4e82c05ecc5142918f67251540331147
msgid ""
"`l_max=12`: Maximum lag to consider (12 weeks). This defines how far back"
" in time the adstock effect extends. For weekly data, 12 weeks (~3 "
"months) is common."
msgstr ""
"`l_max=12`: Rezago máximo a considerar (12 semanas). Define cuán atrás en el"
" tiempo se extiende el efecto del adstock. Para datos semanales, 12 semanas "
"(~3 meses) es un valor común."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:90009
#: 7c93363027974461ad0c3a5e9005b018
msgid ""
"`normalize=True`: Ensures the adstock weights sum to 1, making the "
"transformation  interpretable as a weighted average of past spend values."
msgstr ""
"`normalize=True`: Garantiza que los pesos del adstock sumen 1, lo que hace "
"que la transformación sea interpretable como un promedio ponderado de los "
"valores de gasto pasados."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:90012
