#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:110004
#: ce7fa0169c684ca184b14a9baf4810bc
msgid ""
"**`priors`**: A dictionary specifying the prior distribution for the "
"`alpha` parameter (retention rate). For example, `Prior(\"Beta\", "
"alpha=1, beta=3)` creates a Beta(1,3) prior that favors lower alpha "
"values (faster decay), which is often reasonable for marketing effects."
msgstr ""
