#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240004
#: b4496e8ab70a4a249e0a2b3ea3be170c
msgid "2. Delayed Adstock"
msgstr "2. Adstock con retardo"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240007
#: 54451a64445e42b7892054ef6f5218ba
msgid ""
"Delayed adstock extends geometric adstock by adding a **delay parameter**"
" ($\\theta$) that shifts when the peak effect occurs."
msgstr ""
"El adstock con retardo extiende el adstock geométrico al agregar un "
"**parámetro de retardo** ($\\theta$) que desplaza el momento en que ocurre "
"el efecto máximo."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240011
#: 7557c0b60e824226aa86530da433ece6
msgid ""
"Delayed geometric adstock builds on geometric adstock by adding in a "
"delay $\\theta$ before the maximum adstock is observed (this happens at "
"week 0 for the plain geometric decay)."
msgstr ""
"El adstock geométrico con retardo se basa en el adstock geométrico al añadir"
" un retardo $\\theta$ antes de que se observe el adstock máximo (esto ocurre"
" en la semana 0 en el decaimiento geométrico simple)."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240013
#: c308721755e64a7fa598a73f3fc62451
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It also adds a maximum duration for the carryover/adstock $L_{max}$, such"
" that adstock after this point is 0."
msgstr ""
"También añade una duración máxima para el efecto de arrastre o adstock, "
"$L_{max}$, de modo que el adstock más allá de ese punto es 0."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240015
#: 418ada8c260741fd9397bc1cec8079f6
msgid "The delayed geometric adstock function takes the following form:"
msgstr ""
"La función de adstock geométrico con retardo tiene la siguiente forma:"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240017
#: ab7488fca5d84c409c9ebb88387348a3
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\tilde{x}_t = \\sum_{i=0}^{L_{\\max}-1} \\left( \\alpha^{(i-\\theta)^2} "
"\\cdot x_{t-i} \\right)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\tilde{x}_t = \\sum_{i=0}^{L_{\\max}-1} \\left( \\alpha^{(i-\\theta)^2} \\cdot x_{t-i} \\right)\n"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240022
#: 5272fdb5a2f24e8c934caffca11ef1d7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\tilde{x}_t$ is the transformed value at time $t$ after applying the "
"delayed adstock transformation"
msgstr ""
"$\\tilde{x}_t$ es el valor transformado en el tiempo $t$ tras aplicar la "
"transformación de adstock con retardo"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240023
#: 2ed3829b8d1c4c5ea773a8e397e03605
msgid "$\\alpha$ is the retention rate of the ad effect"
msgstr "$\\alpha$ es la tasa de retención del efecto publicitario"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240024
#: 1f67d79a0ed6473f880060045828aa41
msgid "$\\theta$ represents the delay before the peak effect occurs"
msgstr "$\\theta$ representa el retardo antes de que ocurra el efecto máximo"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240025
#: 7a85e2d6593545fcb51716b5363abdc1
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$L_{max}$ is the maximum duration of the carryover effect"
msgstr "$L_{max}$ es la duración máxima del efecto de arrastre"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240027
#: 1e81ab9586e84b11a00a7fd444cf86a6
msgid ""
"The exponent is squared, so the weights fall away from the peak at $i = "
"\\theta$ symmetrically in both directions rather than decaying "
"geometrically from it."
msgstr ""
"El exponente está elevado al cuadrado, de modo que los pesos se alejan del "
"pico en $i = \\theta$ de forma simétrica en ambas direcciones, en lugar de "
"decaer geométricamente a partir de él."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240030
#: cbaa721642e049a38cefe8936c36858e
msgid "**Broadcast media** (TV, radio) where impact doesn't happen immediately"
msgstr ""
"**Medios masivos** (TV, radio) donde el impacto no ocurre de inmediato"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:240031
#: f5b1b9087f754de8b147a668238b6105
msgid "**Out-of-home advertising** (billboards) with gradual awareness build-up"
msgstr ""
"**Publicidad exterior** (vallas publicitarias) con una acumulación gradual "
