msgid "4. Weibull PDF Adstock"
msgstr "4. Adstock Weibull PDF"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:430007
#: b8c6978e1c4e44fca5f59ef9be7f30ce
msgid ""
"Weibull PDF adstock uses the **probability density function** of the "
"Weibull distribution, creating a **peak effect followed by decay**."
msgstr ""
"El adstock Weibull PDF utiliza la **función de densidad de probabilidad** de"
" la distribución de Weibull, que crea un **efecto máximo seguido de "
"decaimiento**."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:430011
#: 203fe9feacf44fa59879fb0caa5066e8
msgid ""
"The Weibull PDF is a function depending on two variables, $k$ (shape) and"
" $\\lambda$ (scale) and the same remarks for Weibull CDF apply to Weibull"
" PDF."
msgstr ""
"La Weibull PDF es una función que depende de dos variables, $k$ (forma) y "
"$\\lambda$ (escala), y las mismas observaciones hechas para la Weibull CDF "
"se aplican a la Weibull PDF."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:430013
#: c4f377e52f8e4165b6af0a3893f85d4c
msgid ""
"The key difference is that Weibull PDF allows for lagged effects to be "
"taken into account - the **time delay effect**."
msgstr ""
"La diferencia clave es que la Weibull PDF permite tener en cuenta efectos "
"rezagados: el **efecto de retardo temporal**."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:430015
#: 2be3dcaf5740414993f9c4d3e448fff7
msgid "**The Weibull PDF adstock function therefore takes the form :**"
msgstr "**Por lo tanto, la función de adstock Weibull PDF tiene la forma :**"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:430023
#: 9cd5f9501088465eb8009100ccb1fcf5
msgid ""
"**The Weibull PDF is actually used to build the $\\alpha_t$'s, and it "
"takes the form :**"
msgstr ""
"**En realidad, la Weibull PDF se usa para construir los $\\alpha_t$, y tiene"
" la forma :**"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/adstock_functions_guide.ipynb:430025
#: 71054a7c939a41bf872342e7b8c9695d
msgid ""
"\n"
"G_{k,\\lambda}(t) = \\frac{k}{\\lambda}\\Big(\\frac{t}{\\lambda} "
"\\Big)^{k-1}e^{-(\\frac{t}{\\lambda})^k}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"G_{k,\\lambda}(t) = \\frac{k}{\\lambda}\\Big(\\frac{t}{\\lambda} \\Big)^{k-1}e^{-(\\frac{t}{\\lambda})^k}\n"

